{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>We Gotta Go</strong> is a first person co-op horror game where you and your friends have to reach the only bathroom in a haunted mansion before your bowels betray you.  <br><br>The mansion won\u2019t make it easy: its many passages are blocked, locked, hidden, and haunted... can your team survive all the way to the porcelain promised land?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/d7dc3ce67a2e37859f51b3f5f64e43e2.avif?t=1766182118\" width=500 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/0ceea13fc02757ba124dbc3c18c23a43.poster.avif?t=1766182118\" width=500 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/0ceea13fc02757ba124dbc3c18c23a43.webm?t=1766182118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/0ceea13fc02757ba124dbc3c18c23a43.mp4?t=1766182118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fear, stress, and bad burritos all push your gut closer to disaster. Manage your bowels carefully... once you lose control, it\u2019s game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/1a813f831cfc73ba9d53f436517575a5.avif?t=1766182118\" width=500 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/0e7c5aa1e3e3956531662be119da8609.poster.avif?t=1766182118\" width=500 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/0e7c5aa1e3e3956531662be119da8609.webm?t=1766182118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/0e7c5aa1e3e3956531662be119da8609.mp4?t=1766182118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light up lanterns, wield wonky weapons, and fling fancy furniture to break open doors and keep ghosts at bay (or just throw s#!t at your friends).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/600e6d2ce7ff8e169a75ddae349cc0ee.avif?t=1766182118\" width=500 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/3a1b12add44d6e7bd15edf731cf98f39.poster.avif?t=1766182118\" width=500 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/3a1b12add44d6e7bd15edf731cf98f39.webm?t=1766182118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/3a1b12add44d6e7bd15edf731cf98f39.mp4?t=1766182118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Water Ghosts, TP Mummies, and a host of other horrors lurk in the darkness, waiting to scare your pants off. Literally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/ae83c66c544cd2f1d560335da99fae75.avif?t=1766182118\" width=500 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online co-op with proximity voice chat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based combat &amp; item chaos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural haunted mansion layouts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable characters (yes, even after death)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge clothes from corpses to mix up your style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Die, and return as a playable pile of poo</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/f85fa8e3555ceb48f4d695415dc16b54.poster.avif?t=1766182118\" width=500 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/f85fa8e3555ceb48f4d695415dc16b54.webm?t=1766182118\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/extras/f85fa8e3555ceb48f4d695415dc16b54.mp4?t=1766182118\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3967470?t=1766182118","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/774a03baa9e7d570ce752fb87f9a12d1d098d2f3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766182118","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/6a174362852862cee0a7ee0a2633377064db9512/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766182118","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967470/6a174362852862cee0a7ee0a2633377064db9512/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1